{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2020-09-03 19:30:00', 'title': 'FDA APPROVES ADDITIONAL DOSES OF TRULICITY FOR THE TREATMENT OF TYPE 2 DIABETES', 'text': 'FDA APPROVES ADDITIONAL DOSES OF TRULICITY® (DULAGLUTIDE) FOR THE TREATMENT OF TYPE 2 DIABETES.FDA APPROVES ADDITIONAL DOSES OF TRULICITY® (DULAGLUTIDE) FOR THE TREATMENT OF TYPE 2 DIABETES.ELI LILLY AND CO - FDA APPROVED TWO ADDITIONAL DOSES OF TRULICITY.ELI LILLY AND CO - APPROVAL EXPANDS LABEL OF ONCE-WEEKLY TRULICITY TO INCLUDE 3.0 MG AND 4.5 MG DOSES BASED ON DATA FROM AWARD-11.ELI LILLY AND CO - ADDITIONAL DOSES OF TRULICITY WILL BE AVAILABLE IN UNITED STATES PHARMACIES IN LATE SEPTEMBER.'}